[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0010","text":"哦，大家\n聚在一起干什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0020","text":"哦，制作人\n我们正在折纸呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0030","text":"凛世小姐超厉害的！\n帮我折了一只熊猫！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0040","text":"呵呵……\n制作人大人……也折点什么吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0003","text":"鹤……之类的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0004","text":"纸飞机吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_00_0005","text":"折个青蛙吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_01_0010","text":"……咦？\n接下来这步怎么折来着？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_01_0020","text":"那里要这样…………\n……呵呵……折得很好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_02_0010","text":"看招，嗖——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_02_0020","text":"好厉害！\n飞得好远！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_03_0010","text":"这样按一下屁股的话……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03070000_03_0020","text":"哇，跳起来了！\n哈哈哈，还挺可爱的嘛"}]
